{"4707390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "To Def Or Not To Def", "steam_appid": 4707390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/f8ace0280cb57fed23b95792a5ee5ca2.avif?t=1787579570\" width=1186 height=302 /></span><strong> </strong><br> A skeleton army has appeared from… somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers, cast spells, fight beside your defenses, and keep them away from your castle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/18525f86250539767f410c5154cb2b9d.avif?t=1787579570\" width=1186 height=302 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge towers into stronger versions, combine cards and spells, and create a different build every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/8aee039f0ebbb98536e86a9534a85f75.poster.avif?t=1787579570\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/8aee039f0ebbb98536e86a9534a85f75.webm?t=1787579570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/8aee039f0ebbb98536e86a9534a85f75.mp4?t=1787579570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made by One Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve played far too many tower defense and roguelite games, so I made the one I wanted to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want active combat, tower merging, and chaotic builds, you’re in the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Merge. Fight. Defend.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/f8ace0280cb57fed23b95792a5ee5ca2.avif?t=1787579570\" width=1186 height=302 /></span><strong> </strong><br> A skeleton army has appeared from… somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers, cast spells, fight beside your defenses, and keep them away from your castle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/18525f86250539767f410c5154cb2b9d.avif?t=1787579570\" width=1186 height=302 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge towers into stronger versions, combine cards and spells, and create a different build every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/8aee039f0ebbb98536e86a9534a85f75.poster.avif?t=1787579570\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/8aee039f0ebbb98536e86a9534a85f75.webm?t=1787579570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4707390/extras/8aee039f0ebbb98536e86a9534a85f75.mp4?t=1787579570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made by One Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve played far too many tower defense and roguelite games, so I made the one I wanted to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want active combat, tower merging, and chaotic builds, you’re in the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Merge. Fight. Defend.</strong></p>", "short_descr